# Example mkifs / image snippet for the DeadlineLens periodic_task binary.
# This is an example only. The official contest capture used official
# mkqnximage (see notes/build-run-note.md), not this file.

# Place the prebuilt binary (qcc -Vgcc_ntox86_64) into the guest data
# partition, then run it after the image boots.

[/data/home/root/periodic_task]
UID=0 GID=0 PERMS=0755
# host path to the compiled binary, adjusted to your layout:
# periodic_task=target/qnx/periodic_task
